## Swift Package Manager
.build/
.swiftpm/
# No `Packages/` rule here on purpose: TR-0.1 puts our own local packages
# (PowerliftingCore, Persistence, DesignSystem) in Packages/, and they must be
# committed. Fetched dependencies land in .build/, which is already ignored.
# Package.resolved is committed — this is an app, so dependency versions should
# be pinned for reproducible CI builds.

